{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42315","headline":"奉使九华山中途遇青阳薛郎中 · 徐铉","name":"奉使九华山中途遇青阳薛郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人相别动相思，此地相逢岂素期。\n九子峰前闲未得，五谿桥上坐多时。\n甘泉从幸余知忝，宣室徵还子未迟。\n且饮一盃消别恨，野花风起渐离披。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}